{"id":31360089730,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHTTT-gg","head_branch":"fix/2.41-l2-cache-nonstrict-read-write","head_sha":"4185c35380806b8df9f3e8d2792b021b6750b204","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":51904,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: switch reference-metadata L2 cache regions to NONSTRICT_READ_WRITE (2.41)","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":85058415308,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAATzeBqzA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31360089730","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31360089730","pull_requests":[{"id":4242120202,"number":24827,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/24827","head":{"ref":"fix/2.41-l2-cache-nonstrict-read-write","sha":"2fbbd73aea4166e5d7218d1b35280e358312ad97","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"2.41","sha":"f1b6c5b70f604babd0371cb840190949e4e078d9","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-08-10T05:54:28Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T06:09:43Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-10T05:54:28Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31360089730/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31360089730/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/85058415308","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31360089730/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31360089730/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31360089730/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: switch reference-metadata L2 cache regions to NONSTRICT_READ_WRITE (2.41)\n\n2.41 port of the cache-strategy change in #24810. Hibernate 5.6's generic\ncache SPI (org.hibernate.cache.spi.support.AbstractReadWriteAccess) backs\nREAD_WRITE region locking for both Ehcache3/JCache (master) and the legacy\nEhcache2 hibernate-ehcache module 2.41 still runs (confirmed:\nStorageAccessImpl implements the same DomainDataStorageAccess SPI) - the\nper-region, non-striped ReentrantReadWriteLock that #24810 fixes on master\napplies here too, not just under JCache.\n\nFlips the same reference-metadata regions #24810 flips - Category*,\nCategoryOption*, DataElement*, Indicator*, Legend*, Option*,\nOrganisationUnit*, PeriodType - from read-write to nonstrict-read-write in\n2.41's .hbm.xml mappings (2.41 has no Java @Cache annotations; all L2\nmapping is hbm.xml-based). Period/RelativePeriods intentionally excluded,\nmatching #24810.\n\nThree entity-level regions - CategoryCombo, LegendSet, OptionSet - exist\nonly on 2.41 (master doesn't cache those entities at all, only their\ncollections), so #24810 never touches them; left as read-write here to\nmatch its exact scope rather than expanding it unreviewed.\n\nOut of scope, deliberately: #24810's ehcache.xml predefined-region/\nstore-by-reference changes address JCache's jsr107 MissingCacheStrategy\ndefault (store-by-value via SerializingCopier) - 2.41's Ehcache2 caches\nare already store-by-reference by default, so that part doesn't apply.\nThe HibernateJobConfigurationStore synchronized-query-space fix is a\nseparate concern (#24803's wipe fix) not requested here.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"4185c35380806b8df9f3e8d2792b021b6750b204","tree_id":"33983c89800dd451cb12d96b2c07fb754b332c30","timestamp":"2026-08-10T05:47:23Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"